-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path d="M12 4.5C16.4183 4.5 20 8.08172 20 12.5V12.6455C21.4457 13.0758 22.5 14.4145 22.5 16C22.5 17.933 20.933 19.5 19 19.5C17.067 19.5 15.5 17.933 15.5 16C15.5 14.4145 16.5543 13.0758 18 12.6455V12.5C18 9.18629 15.3137 6.5 12 6.5C8.68629 6.5 6 9.18629 6 12.5V12.6455C7.44566 13.0758 8.5 14.4145 8.5 16C8.5 17.933 6.933 19.5 5 19.5C3.067 19.5 1.5 17.933 1.5 16C1.5 14.4145 2.55434 13.0758 4 12.6455V12.5C4 8.08172 7.58172 4.5 12 4.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Bridge Monero to Hyperliquid</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Wagyu also runs the native bridge between Monero and Hyperliquid. Deposit XMR and receive XMR1, the Monero representation on Hyperliquid, at your Hyperliquid address; send XMR1 back and receive native XMR.</p><p>The terms below come from the bridge API<!-- -->, fetched Oct 9, 2026, 7:04 AM UTC<!-- -->. Check the bridge widget before sending. <!-- -->Deposits are available; withdrawals are available.<!-- --> XMR1 lets you trade Monero with orderbook liquidity and low fees, then exit back to native XMR whenever you want.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3"><div data-slot="stat" data-page-panel="true" class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-1 rounded-2xl border-[1.5px] border-border-subtle bg-card px-4 py-2.5"><p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-muted-foreground">Deposit fee</p><div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground">0%</div></div><div data-slot="stat" data-page-panel="true" class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-1 rounded-2xl border-[1.5px] border-border-subtle bg-card px-4 py-2.5"><p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-muted-foreground">Withdrawal fee</p><div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground">2% + 0 XMR</div></div><div data-slot="stat" data-page-panel="true" class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-1 rounded-2xl border-[1.5px] border-border-subtle bg-card px-4 py-2.5"><p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-muted-foreground">Minimum</p><div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground">0.01 XMR</div></div></div><div><a class="group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border border-transparent bg-clip-padding font-extrabold whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-5 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-hover active:bg-primary-pressed h-10 gap-1.5 rounded-full px-4 text-base" href="/bridge">Bridge XMR to Hyperliquid</a></div></div></section><section id="fees-h" aria-label="Fees, minimums and timing"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M8 2C5.79086 2 4 3.79086 4 6V21C4 21.3905 4.22734 21.7453 4.58214 21.9085C4.93694 22.0717 5.35428 22.0134 5.65079 21.7593L7.33333 20.3171L9.01588 21.7593C9.39036 22.0802 9.94297 22.0802 10.3175 21.7593L12 20.3171L13.6825 21.7593C14.057 22.0802 14.6096 22.0802 14.9841 21.7593L16.6667 20.3171L18.3492 21.7593C18.6457 22.0134 19.0631 22.0717 19.4179 21.9085C19.7727 21.7453 20 21.3905 20 21V6C20 3.79086 18.2091 2 16 2H8ZM15.9571 7.04289C16.3476 7.43342 16.3476 8.06658 15.9571 8.45711L9.45711 14.9571C9.06658 15.3476 8.43342 15.3476 8.04289 14.9571C7.65237 14.5666 7.65237 13.9334 8.04289 13.5429L14.5429 7.04289C14.9334 6.65237 15.5666 6.65237 15.9571 7.04289ZM10.25 8C10.25 8.69036 9.69036 9.25 9 9.25C8.30964 9.25 7.75 8.69036 7.75 8C7.75 7.30964 8.30964 6.75 9 6.75C9.69036 6.75 10.25 7.30964 10.25 8ZM15 15.25C15.6904 15.25 16.25 14.6904 16.25 14C16.25 13.3096 15.6904 12.75 15 12.75C14.3096 12.75 13.75 13.3096 13.75 14C13.75 14.6904 14.3096 15.25 15 15.25Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Fees, minimums and timing</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Quote snapshots refresh every 10 minutes: <!-- -->SOL to XMR: updated Oct 9, 2026, 7:04 AM UTC; BTC to XMR: updated Oct 9, 2026, 7:04 AM UTC; XMR to BTC: updated Oct 9, 2026, 7:04 AM UTC<!-- -->.</p></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 p-4"><h3 class="text-base font-extrabold leading-6 tracking-tight text-foreground">Fees</h3><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Example route fees: SOL to XMR 2%, BTC to XMR 2%, XMR to BTC 0%. Your quote shows applicable trading, routing and rounding costs as well. Your deposit network fee is separate; the final output can change during execution.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 p-4"><h3 class="text-base font-extrabold leading-6 tracking-tight text-foreground">Minimums</h3><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Default-network minimums: SOL to XMR $20, BTC to XMR $40, XMR to BTC $25. Other routes and networks have their own minimums; check the quote before sending.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 p-4"><h3 class="text-base font-extrabold leading-6 tracking-tight text-foreground">Timing</h3><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Editorial estimates from deposit detection: USDC to XMR on Arbitrum around 1 minute, SOL to XMR around 2 minutes, BTC to XMR around 20 minutes. These are typical times, not measured medians. The widget estimates your actual swap; confirmations and large orders can take longer.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 p-4"><h3 class="text-base font-extrabold leading-6 tracking-tight text-foreground">Limits</h3><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>There is no daily limit. Very large orders are routed in slices; the quote reflects the available liquidity.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="who-h" aria-label="Who Wagyu is for"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path d="M12 2C9.51472 2 7.5 4.01472 7.5 6.5C7.5 8.98528 9.51472 11 12 11C14.4853 11 16.5 8.98528 16.5 6.5C16.5 4.01472 14.4853 2 12 2Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12.0001 12C8.64237 12 5.96263 13.7661 4.55269 16.3886C3.92347 17.5589 4.16063 18.7737 4.85818 19.6414C5.53148 20.479 6.62375 21 7.79536 21H16.2049C17.3765 21 18.4687 20.479 19.142 19.6414C19.8396 18.7737 20.0768 17.5589 19.4475 16.3886C18.0376 13.7661 15.3578 12 12.0001 12Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Who Wagyu is for</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><ul><li>Anyone who has had a withdrawal frozen by an exchange and does not want it to happen again.</li><li>Traders moving between XMR and Hyperliquid or other chains who want their funds swapped or returned, never held.</li><li>Wallets, apps and agents that need a Monero swap or bridge through a public API.<!-- --> <a class="rounded-sm font-extrabold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring" href="/api">Build with the Wagyu API</a></li></ul></div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>New to Monero? Start with <a class="rounded-sm font-extrabold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring" href="/blog/how-to-buy-monero-without-kyc">how to buy Monero without KYC</a>. New to Zcash? Read <a class="rounded-sm font-extrabold text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-primary focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus-ring" href="/blog/how-to-buy-zcash-without-kyc">how to buy Zcash without KYC</a>.</p></div></div></section><section id="faq-h" aria-label="Frequently asked questions"><div data-slot="card" data-size="default" class="group/card flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-sm [--card-spacing:--spacing(4)] has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 has-[&gt;img:first-child]:pt-0 data-[size=sm]:[--card-spacing:--spacing(3)] data-[size=sm]:has-data-[slot=card-footer]:pb-0 *:[img:first-child]:rounded-t-xl *:[img:last-child]:rounded-b-xl rounded-[var(--wagyu-card-radius)] bg-surface text-foreground shadow-sm ring-1 ring-inset ring-border-subtle gap-5 p-5 sm:p-6" data-page-section="center" data-page-panel="true"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-0 px-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5 text-input-placeholder"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 17.5228 6.47715 22 12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2ZM10 11C10 10.4477 10.4477 10 11 10H12C12.5523 10 13 10.4477 13 11V16C13 16.5523 12.5523 17 12 17C11.4477 17 11 16.5523 11 16V12C10.4477 12 10 11.5523 10 11ZM12 7C11.4477 7 11 7.44772 11 8C11 8.55228 11.4477 9 12 9C12.5523 9 13 8.55228 13 8C13 7.44772 12.5523 7 12 7Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><h2 class="text-[22px] font-black text-foreground dark:text-white">Frequently asked questions</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><details open="" class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Where can I swap XMR privately?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Choose a supported asset, amount and Monero receiving address on this page. Screening and refund rules are set out in the compliance policy.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Can Monero be swapped for Bitcoin?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Yes. Send XMR to the deposit address and receive BTC at your Bitcoin address, or the reverse.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Can my funds be frozen when converting XMR to BTC?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Screening applies before execution. Failed checks normally enter a refund flow, which can require a refund address and further checks. Legal restrictions described in the compliance policy can affect payouts and refunds.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Does Wagyu hold my funds?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>No. Your deposit is swapped and sent to your address, or refunded.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">What happens if the compliance screening flags my deposit?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Screening runs before execution. A failed check normally enters the refund flow; it can require a refund address and further checks. The compliance policy describes legal restrictions and exceptions.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">How long does a Monero swap take?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Typical editorial estimates include around 1 minute for USDC to XMR on Arbitrum and around 20 minutes for BTC to XMR, from deposit detection. Your selected network, confirmations and order size can change the timing. The widget estimates your actual swap. Received XMR needs more confirmations before it is spendable.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Is there a minimum amount?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>On default networks, SOL to XMR starts at $20, BTC to XMR at $40, and XMR to BTC at $25. The XMR bridge minimum is 0.01 XMR. Check the quote for your selected route.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Is Wagyu a DEX?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Not in the strict sense, and we prefer to be precise. Cross-chain routing uses a decentralized aggregator and XMR trades execute on Hyperliquid&#x27;s decentralized orderbook, but the Monero side of the bridge is operated by Wagyu. What protects you is not a label, it is the design: screening before the swap and automatic refunds.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Can I use Wagyu from any country?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>Wagyu is available worldwide, except in territories under comprehensive sanctions listed in the compliance policy.</p></div></div></details><details class="group rounded-[var(--wagyu-panel-radius)] bg-card px-4"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg py-4 text-sm font-extrabold leading-6 text-foreground outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Can I buy Monero with a credit card on Wagyu?<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 motion-reduce:transition-none"><path d="M8 10L10.9393 12.9393C11.5251 13.5251 12.4749 13.5251 13.0607 12.9393L16 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="pb-4"><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-3 text-pretty text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground [&amp;_strong]:font-extrabold [&amp;_strong]:text-foreground [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:space-y-3 [&amp;_ul]:pl-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:space-y-4 [&amp;_ol]:pl-5 [&amp;_li::marker]:font-extrabold [&amp;_li::marker]:text-primary"><p>No. Wagyu swaps crypto for crypto. If you are starting from fiat, you need to get your first coins elsewhere and then swap them to XMR here.</p></div></div></details></div></div></section></article></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="pointer-events-none relative inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 md:fixed"><div class="relative bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#040404]/35 to-[#040404]/80 py-4"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_bottom,transparent,black_45%)] supports-backdrop-filter:backdrop-blur-[3px]"></div><div class="pointer-events-auto relative flex flex-col items-center gap-2 px-4 text-white sm:px-8 md:flex-row md:justify-between lg:px-20"><p class="hidden w-[122px] text-sm font-bold text-white/80 md:block">© 2026 Wagyu</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center just